Third-party components in this repository
==========================================

DimmableR4Matrix (lib/DimmableR4Matrix/)
----------------------------------------
A patched fork of the Arduino_LED_Matrix library, generated by
tools/make_dimmable_matrix.py from the copy bundled with the UNO R4 board
package (framework-arduinorenesas-uno 1.5.1).

